WEBVTT

00:02.980 --> 00:06.480
From yesterday's me to tomorrow's me:

00:06.940 --> 00:10.570
Don't mind about the lost diary pages.

00:10.570 --> 00:13.440
I just tore out and threw away the pages on which I made writing mistakes.

00:13.700 --> 00:16.740
I didn't have any unhappy experiences.

00:16.740 --> 00:18.540
Rather, I was happy.

00:18.780 --> 00:21.950
It was a happiness I didn't really deserve.

00:22.410 --> 00:25.590
That's why it was just a writing mistake.

00:25.580 --> 00:28.210
Something that never happened from the very beginning.

00:28.210 --> 00:30.210
Therefore, I tore them out and threw them away.

00:30.460 --> 00:34.050
Please don't worry about it, and continue living your days as before.

00:34.050 --> 00:40.890
And... please don't get involved with a person called Asou Renji-san from now on.

00:40.890 --> 00:45.480
It will bring unhappiness to both you and him.

00:46.020 --> 00:49.030
To: tomorrow's me. From: yesterday's me.

00:50.730 --> 01:03.160
itsuka atarashii sekai ni  habatakeru no

00:50.730 --> 01:03.160
Fly high, make it, get to the new world that I seek
Someday, so I believe

01:03.370 --> 01:15.670
yuuyami semaru machi no keshiki ni  tatazumu hitori de

01:03.370 --> 01:15.670
Why am I standing alone in the twilight
Let me go, no more lonely nights

01:16.300 --> 01:22.350
kasumu sora  yuragu kuuki sae

01:16.300 --> 01:22.350
I take a deep breath under the hazy sky

01:22.720 --> 01:28.810
zutto nanika sagashite

01:22.720 --> 01:28.810
Feel like losing, but it's gonna be alright

01:29.020 --> 01:34.820
shizumu kurai yoru no

01:29.020 --> 01:34.820
Break through the night, go and try to fight

01:34.990 --> 01:41.950
mukou he hashiridasu

01:34.990 --> 01:41.950
Don't be afraid, now is the time

01:45.160 --> 01:57.630
takanaru mune no kodou  furikiru geeji

01:45.160 --> 01:57.630
Be alive, take it, I surely feel my heartbeat
There's no limit to my reach

01:57.970 --> 02:04.100
afureru namida wo kechirase

01:57.970 --> 02:04.100
I say good-bye to my tears that I don't need

02:04.350 --> 02:10.850
yume tsukande

02:04.350 --> 02:10.850
So believe in my dream

03:15.410 --> 03:19.700
It has already been a long thirteen hours since Chihiro and I broke up.

03:20.370 --> 03:24.040
I bet Chihiro has already forgotten what happened yesterday.

03:24.790 --> 03:29.460
Not just what happened yesterday, but everything since the day we met.

03:30.210 --> 03:32.590
Everything about me...

03:45.730 --> 03:47.570
Chihiro is the same as usual.

03:48.400 --> 03:52.030
She's the same as the Chihiro from before she met you.

03:53.200 --> 03:57.030
Do you know why she wrote a novel like that?

03:58.700 --> 04:01.290
I'll listen if you've got something to say.

04:03.120 --> 04:05.170
I see. It's painful, isn't it?

04:05.420 --> 04:08.290
Please don't be so nice to me.

04:09.550 --> 04:13.340
If you do, it will look like it's really over, won't it?

04:13.340 --> 04:15.130
It's really over.

04:16.010 --> 04:20.720
Strictly speaking, Chihiro's problem isn't that she forgets what has happened.

04:20.720 --> 04:22.930
She can't remember it in her brain.

04:23.600 --> 04:28.020
It's a result of repeatedly losing thirteen hours of memories.

04:30.320 --> 04:33.740
Present-day medicine can't make Chihiro better.

04:33.740 --> 04:39.030
Even if a miracle occurs and her illness is cured, her lost memories will never come back.

04:41.120 --> 04:46.040
Besides, miracles don't exist in this world.

04:46.040 --> 04:50.840
There are only inevitabilities and accidents, and what you're going to do. That's it.

04:51.800 --> 04:56.010
It's painful to be unable to reach the person you love.

04:56.010 --> 05:00.220
But if you keep grieving over it, the burden in your heart will just get heavier.

05:00.470 --> 05:03.850
Even so, there's no way I can forget about it!

05:03.850 --> 05:05.390
I didn't tell you to forget about it.

05:06.850 --> 05:10.650
Going on with your life while shouldering that burden is also a way to live.

05:11.190 --> 05:13.530
I won't tell you to do that though.

05:17.200 --> 05:19.160
Can I ask you something?

05:19.160 --> 05:20.070
What is it?

05:20.070 --> 05:25.250
Are you always at the church because you're shouldering a burden?

05:25.250 --> 05:27.750
I wonder. I've already forgotten the reason.

05:35.800 --> 05:36.760
Come in.

05:39.220 --> 05:40.350
What?

05:40.350 --> 05:43.180
Nothing. I was just wondering what happened to you.

05:43.180 --> 05:44.520
Nothing.

05:44.520 --> 05:49.350
Really? By the way, isn't it almost time to submit your career interest survey?

05:49.600 --> 05:50.360
Yeah.

05:50.360 --> 05:52.520
Have you decided what you want to do?

05:52.520 --> 05:54.190
No, not yet.

05:54.190 --> 05:58.860
I see. Take your time. It's your dream after all.

05:58.860 --> 05:59.570
I can't do it.

06:00.620 --> 06:04.580
I can't even think about tomorrow, let alone such a distant future.

06:05.620 --> 06:07.960
There won't be a "tomorrow".

06:07.960 --> 06:08.960
Renji...

06:08.960 --> 06:11.960
It'd be nice if tomorrow never came.

06:11.960 --> 06:13.960
You shouldn't say something like that.

06:13.960 --> 06:17.670
Couldn't tomorrow possibly be a better day than today?

06:19.800 --> 06:22.100
What's wrong, Renji? Where are you going?

06:26.930 --> 06:30.310
Couldn't tomorrow possibly be a better day than today?

06:32.770 --> 06:35.020
There's no way that could be true.

06:37.690 --> 06:40.320
What are you grieving over, young man?

06:40.700 --> 06:41.780
Kuze-san...

06:43.660 --> 06:44.580
Here you go.

06:44.870 --> 06:46.330
Thank you.

06:48.620 --> 06:51.250
Human beings are cruel.

06:52.290 --> 06:54.590
Even though it's heartbreaking, I feel hungry.

06:54.590 --> 06:56.380
Even though it's painful, I feel sleepy.

06:56.380 --> 07:00.260
And, even though it's painful for me, I still eat and sleep peacefully.

07:00.260 --> 07:03.850
I can't forgive myself, and hence it becomes even more painful.

07:03.850 --> 07:06.760
But, that proves you're alive.

07:07.020 --> 07:08.100
Kuze-san...

07:08.100 --> 07:09.310
What is it?

07:09.310 --> 07:12.100
What should I do to fulfill my dream?

07:12.100 --> 07:17.030
Let's see. To fulfill your dream, you need to have a dream first.

07:17.360 --> 07:18.860
To have a dream?

07:18.860 --> 07:22.240
You might think it's obvious, but it's a very important something.

07:22.240 --> 07:27.040
You can have an image, a desire, or a wish of what you want to become.

07:27.040 --> 07:28.080
Wish...

07:28.870 --> 07:31.540
This is what I wanted to become.

07:32.000 --> 07:35.250
Don't forget about it, and keep wishing for it.

07:35.250 --> 07:37.300
That's the first step to fulfilling your dream.

07:37.800 --> 07:40.970
What if the dream is something impossible?

07:40.970 --> 07:43.130
You can only wait for a miracle to happen.

07:43.890 --> 07:46.220
Miracles don't exist in this world.

07:46.220 --> 07:51.060
"There are only inevitabilities and accidents, and what you're going to do."

07:51.060 --> 07:52.520
That's Himura's favorite phrase, isn't it?

07:53.350 --> 07:57.070
But sometimes the outcome of your action, which becomes inevitable,

07:57.070 --> 08:01.490
will overlap with accidents, and fulfill your dream unexpectedly.

08:02.150 --> 08:06.910
I don't know if that can be called a miracle, but there's one thing I'm certain about.

08:08.030 --> 08:10.870
Nothing will happen if you don't wish for it.

08:21.880 --> 08:23.420
Wish... eh?

08:23.970 --> 08:27.390
No matter how much I wish for them, there are things I can't do anything about.

08:27.850 --> 08:30.890
Chihiro's memories won't come back once they disappear.

08:31.430 --> 08:33.770
The time that she spent with me has already...

08:41.860 --> 08:45.410
I always felt like crying.

08:45.410 --> 08:50.120
I always looked up at the sky because I felt like my tears were going to start.

08:50.450 --> 08:51.620
Chihiro...

08:56.330 --> 08:57.580
E-Excuse me...

08:57.580 --> 08:58.580
Yes?

09:00.340 --> 09:03.300
Erm, can I ask you something strange?

09:04.590 --> 09:07.720
Have we met before?

09:17.520 --> 09:20.190
Even though I remember.

09:23.690 --> 09:26.570
Even though I remember everything.

09:27.030 --> 09:28.740
Even though I can't forget.

09:29.820 --> 09:33.330
How is that... How is that possible?!

10:26.550 --> 10:27.420
Chihiro...

10:28.340 --> 10:31.180
I'm going to break up with Renji-kun soon.

10:31.180 --> 10:37.520
Even though it will be painful and lonely, I decided from the beginning that this would be the last time.

10:37.520 --> 10:39.100
That's why I could put up with it.

10:39.640 --> 10:42.400
Because it was the last time, we kissed many times.

10:42.400 --> 10:45.110
Because it was the last time, we did it many times.

10:45.110 --> 10:49.490
Even though it's sad, this memory will soon disappear too.

10:49.490 --> 10:53.200
Even so, I think I'll be fine.

10:53.200 --> 10:58.870
No matter how painful it is, no matter how lonely it is, I'll forget about these feelings right away.

10:59.710 --> 11:05.800
But now I still remember them, so it's heartbreaking. It's very painful.

11:05.800 --> 11:10.010
Renji-kun's warmth still remains in my heart.

11:10.510 --> 11:14.260
To tell the truth, I want to be with Renji-kun just like this all the time.

11:14.260 --> 11:16.010
I want to feel Renji-kun all the time.

11:16.470 --> 11:19.100
I want to spend time with Renji-kun just like before.

11:20.020 --> 11:22.690
I don't want to forget. I don't want to disappear.

11:22.690 --> 11:26.020
I don't want to return to those empty days anymore.

11:26.690 --> 11:31.280
Renji-kun was the knight who saved me from agony.

11:31.860 --> 11:37.830
Renji-kun was the prince who rescued me from within everlasting time.

11:38.910 --> 11:46.040
Even though I'll forget, even though I'll disappear, I love Renji-kun.

11:46.630 --> 11:50.800
No matter how much time passes, even if everything disappeared from within me,

11:50.800 --> 11:55.930
at this very moment, I love Renji-kun from the bottom of my heart.

11:56.300 --> 11:59.430
Renji-kun, thank you for everything.

12:00.180 --> 12:02.770
And... farewell.

12:17.870 --> 12:20.080
There's still something I can do.

12:20.660 --> 12:24.870
It could be a waste of effort, but... but...

13:36.450 --> 13:38.530
Even though there are still missing pages...

13:38.950 --> 13:40.620
Even though there are still a lot of missing pages...

13:42.120 --> 13:43.580
I'll gather them.

13:43.580 --> 13:45.620
I'll definitely gather all of them together.

13:47.120 --> 13:50.000
That's why... That's why, don't...

13:50.000 --> 13:53.500
Thirteen hours is a long time.

13:54.550 --> 13:57.800
Why are you doing that?

13:57.800 --> 13:59.300
Chihiro...

13:59.300 --> 14:04.100
Even though I shouldn't... Even though I should forget about you...

14:05.350 --> 14:09.560
I've been thinking back on it over and over again.

14:09.560 --> 14:11.860
I can't do it. I can't do it.

14:11.860 --> 14:15.610
I can't stop thinking about you for thirteen hours.

14:15.610 --> 14:17.110
Chihiro!

14:22.830 --> 14:25.450
I'm sorry. I'm sorry.

14:25.450 --> 14:27.330
I won't let you forget anymore.

14:28.540 --> 14:31.040
I won't let you forget no matter what happens.

14:33.290 --> 14:35.800
I'll always be with you.

14:36.800 --> 14:40.130
That's why... That's why...

14:44.640 --> 14:45.890
Renji-kun!

14:46.180 --> 14:47.140
Chihiro!

14:52.980 --> 14:55.860
We'll definitely... always be together.

15:00.570 --> 15:04.410
I believe everyone has prayed to God at least once.

15:04.410 --> 15:11.460
Even though they might not believe, one day they will surely make an honest prayer.

15:11.460 --> 15:13.460
Something that everyone is looking for.

15:13.460 --> 15:15.590
Something that everyone is after.

15:15.590 --> 15:19.130
Something that's created from everyone's continuous wish and the bonds between them.

15:19.130 --> 15:20.930
The thing that's created is...

15:40.780 --> 15:46.030
Geez, I told you guys to free some space on the hard drive, didn't I? I can't edit.

15:46.030 --> 15:49.080
President, are you still playing with that?

15:49.080 --> 15:52.960
You should give up and work on something new to change your mood.

15:52.960 --> 15:55.250
It's okay. Let me do what I want.

15:55.710 --> 15:59.210
Good Work

15:56.420 --> 15:57.960
It wouldn't end like this.

15:57.960 --> 16:00.800
There's no way one of his movies would end like this.

16:03.590 --> 16:07.060
Even though it's frustrating, the movie sparkles.

16:07.890 --> 16:11.020
Shouldn't you see how it goes for a little longer?

16:11.020 --> 16:13.900
You just heard today that your recovery is complete, right?

16:13.900 --> 16:18.730
No, I can't stay still anymore. With my body feeling so light...

16:18.730 --> 16:20.740
Hey, Kei-chan!

16:33.920 --> 16:36.670
Oh, what's for breakfast?

16:36.670 --> 16:42.050
It's dinner if you consider the time. I already finished school.

16:42.050 --> 16:44.720
You don't need to make something complicated.

16:44.720 --> 16:46.720
You're going to have exams soon, aren't you?

16:46.720 --> 16:48.550
No problem, no problem.

16:48.550 --> 16:51.560
My brain is different from yours.

16:51.560 --> 16:56.980
On that subject, can't you do something about your lifestyle of sleeping during the day and waking up in the evening?

16:57.230 --> 16:59.110
It's okay, isn't it?

16:59.110 --> 17:04.280
We have enough time to be together, and we won't disturb each other's work and studies.

17:04.280 --> 17:05.740
Isn't it all good?

17:05.740 --> 17:07.870
Menu planning will be a problem.

17:07.870 --> 17:11.410
Our breakfasts and dinners will be reversed, won't they?

17:11.410 --> 17:14.410
I don't mind eating fried meat after waking up though.

17:14.410 --> 17:17.130
My pride won't allow that.

17:17.130 --> 17:21.500
I've decided that I'll come up with a breakfast menu when you get up.

17:21.500 --> 17:24.130
You don't really need to take it so seriously.

17:24.130 --> 17:26.220
I want to.

17:27.550 --> 17:31.890
Because I want you to eat it while it's still warm.

17:31.890 --> 17:33.890
Incoming Call History

17:31.890 --> 17:33.890
Kei

17:31.890 --> 17:33.890
Miyako

17:31.890 --> 17:33.890
Tsutsumi

17:31.890 --> 17:33.890
Kyosuke

17:31.890 --> 17:33.890
Oomura-san

17:34.520 --> 17:36.850
Huh, it's from Kei.

17:36.850 --> 17:39.400
Ah, how did it go for Kei-chan this morning?

17:39.400 --> 17:42.030
"Completely recovered. Going to club activities right now."

17:39.400 --> 17:42.030
Received Mail

17:39.400 --> 17:42.030
Kei

17:39.400 --> 17:42.030
Exam Result

17:39.400 --> 17:42.030
Completely recovered.

17:39.400 --> 17:42.030
Going to club activities right now.

17:42.360 --> 17:43.650
So she said.

17:44.360 --> 17:46.150
I'm glad to hear that.

17:46.150 --> 17:47.160
Received Mail

17:46.150 --> 17:47.160
Kei

17:46.150 --> 17:47.160
Exam Result

17:46.150 --> 17:47.160
Don't force yourself anymore.

17:46.150 --> 17:47.160
Hiro & Miyako

17:51.780 --> 17:54.450
Don't you think Hiro-senpai is mean?

17:54.450 --> 17:57.330
He pretended to be a perverted and geeky student,

17:57.330 --> 18:02.340
but his real identity is Shindou Nagi-sensei, whom I really admire.

18:02.340 --> 18:05.130
I feel totally betrayed.

18:05.130 --> 18:07.880
I really hate him right now. I'm extremely angry.

18:07.880 --> 18:10.470
You don't need to be that mad, do you?

18:10.470 --> 18:13.390
Hm, are you taking Hiro-senpai's side?

18:13.390 --> 18:15.480
Is this the rumored friendship between guys?

18:15.480 --> 18:17.690
Have you fallen for a man?

18:17.690 --> 18:19.940
Is this the joyful and embarrassing boys love?

18:19.940 --> 18:21.360
What are you talking about?

18:24.570 --> 18:25.900
All right.

18:26.150 --> 18:28.070
This is as far as you guys go then.

18:28.570 --> 18:29.780
H-Here?

18:29.780 --> 18:33.160
Because beyond here is the place where I fight.

18:34.290 --> 18:37.540
I see. Well then, good luck.

18:38.620 --> 18:40.250
Yeah. Say, Senpai.

18:40.500 --> 18:41.750
What is it?

18:42.880 --> 18:44.250
Thank you.

18:44.250 --> 18:50.050
I can now walk on my own feet. Anywhere I go, I'll be running towards it.

18:50.050 --> 18:51.760
Make sure to follow me closely.

18:52.890 --> 18:53.760
Okay.

18:55.220 --> 18:59.770
That's right. I can't keep waiting forever for someone to take my hand.

18:59.770 --> 19:03.270
Be careful, Kei-senpai.

19:07.280 --> 19:08.440
I got it.

19:19.790 --> 19:22.290
CAREER INTEREST SURVEY

19:19.790 --> 19:22.290
Grade

19:19.790 --> 19:22.290
Class

19:19.790 --> 19:22.290
Full Name

19:19.790 --> 19:22.290
1st Choice

19:19.790 --> 19:22.290
2nd Choice

19:19.790 --> 19:22.290
3rd Choice

19:19.790 --> 19:22.290
NOVELIST

19:26.670 --> 19:28.130
Ah, come to think of it...

19:28.130 --> 19:30.220
What is it, Renji-kun?

19:30.220 --> 19:37.310
You said before that you were more afraid of being forgotten than of disappearing, right?

19:37.770 --> 19:41.440
Yeah, I might've said that.

19:41.690 --> 19:44.940
I see. Yeah, I've decided.

19:52.410 --> 19:56.030
I liked that place.

19:52.530 --> 20:04.920
I liked that place.
The quiet, empty train station
where nobody came was
the best for reading alone.
However—
Someone got here before me today.

19:56.030 --> 20:00.870
The quiet, empty train station where nobody came was the best place for reading alone.

20:00.870 --> 20:03.500
However, someone got here before me today.

20:04.920 --> 20:10.420
That was —

20:04.920 --> 20:10.420
an encounter that lasted

20:04.920 --> 20:10.420
less than forty-five seconds.

20:05.420 --> 20:09.210
That was an encounter that lasted less than forty-five seconds.

20:23.770 --> 20:26.230
Oh. It's from Chihiro.

20:26.230 --> 20:28.070
What does Chihiro-chan say?

20:28.940 --> 20:34.450
It seems that in order to fulfill your dream, the first step is to keep wishing for it.

20:34.450 --> 20:39.830
Yeah. I found my dream, thanks to you.

20:40.200 --> 20:43.710
I saw the color I had always been looking for.

20:43.710 --> 20:49.130
I haven't found my dream yet, but I've found my way of living.

20:49.130 --> 20:50.380
Way of living?

20:50.380 --> 20:52.470
Meaning, to be with you.

20:52.800 --> 20:57.300
I understood what kind of movies I want to make.

20:57.300 --> 21:00.970
Right now, I want to keep running with all my heart.

21:00.970 --> 21:05.730
I'm already satisfied that my last dream had come true.

21:06.270 --> 21:07.860
It's not the last one.

21:08.150 --> 21:10.360
This is only the beginning.

21:10.650 --> 21:13.230
I will walk down the path together with you.

21:19.450 --> 21:25.160
tooku sora mado no mukou

21:19.450 --> 21:25.160
In the faraway sky, on the other side of the window

21:26.200 --> 21:32.050
todokanai kumo miteita

21:26.200 --> 21:32.050
I saw clouds I couldn't reach

21:32.500 --> 21:38.470
kowareteku kokoro iyasu

21:32.500 --> 21:38.470
It heals my broken heart

21:39.450 --> 21:45.440
yasashii oto kikoeta

21:39.450 --> 21:45.440
To hear some gentle sound

21:46.110 --> 21:56.780
tenohira koboreochiru yume no kakera

21:46.110 --> 21:56.780
Fragments of dreams scatter on the palm of my hand

21:59.330 --> 22:11.630
nakushita kotae sagasu tame hashiridasu

21:59.330 --> 22:11.630
I start running to find the answer I lost

22:11.630 --> 22:18.640
meguriau toki wo koe

22:11.630 --> 22:18.640
I cross the time I encountered you

22:18.770 --> 22:25.310
futatsu no te kasanaru

22:18.770 --> 22:25.310
For our hands to touch each other

22:25.420 --> 22:31.860
maiagare sora takaku

22:25.420 --> 22:31.860
Fly high in the sky

22:31.950 --> 22:40.700
tsubasa nado nakute mo

22:31.950 --> 22:40.700
Even if you've lost your wings

23:03.010 --> 23:05.350
My, good evening.

23:06.430 --> 23:07.350
Yo.

23:07.810 --> 23:10.850
I've made you wait for a very long time.

23:12.980 --> 23:16.110
I see. Sorry about that, Yuko.

23:16.110 --> 23:19.110
It's been a long time, Yu-kun.

23:20.150 --> 23:25.080
Put your wishes into the memories you do not want to forget...
